sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio as Chat / Evidence UI
    participant Loader as PDF Preview Loader
    participant API as Java PDF API
    participant Auth as Paper Access Filter
    participant MinIO
    participant PDFJS as PDF.js

    User->>Folio: open citation
    Folio->>Loader: createPdfPreviewSource(url, token)
    Loader->>Loader: check source/range cache
    alt cache hit
        Loader-->>PDFJS: cached bytes
    else first open
        Loader->>API: GET Range bytes=0-1048575
        API->>Auth: authenticate + authorize paper
        Auth-->>API: allowed
        API->>MinIO: read initial range
        MinIO-->>API: PDF bytes
        API-->>Loader: 206 + Content-Range
        Loader-->>PDFJS: PDFDataRangeTransport + initialData
        loop missing PDF ranges
            PDFJS->>Loader: requestDataRange(begin, end)
            Loader->>Loader: deduplicate + range cache
            Loader->>API: GET PDF Range
            API->>MinIO: read target range
            MinIO-->>API: range bytes
            API-->>Loader: 206 Partial Content
            Loader-->>PDFJS: onDataRange
        end
    end
    PDFJS-->>Folio: page + text layer + evidence boxes
